                    <span>🏔️</span> TrekTravel
                </h5>
                <p class="small text-secondary mb-2">
                    Climb Higher. Travel Smarter. A premier high-altitude trek discovery and departure slot reservation platform connecting verified travellers with certified mountain operators.
                </p>
                <div class="small text-secondary">
                    Secure JDBC • RBAC Security • Concurrency Slot Locking
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
